{"id": "gift-list-drops-original-filings", "title": "Published gift list drops the original filing when a report is amended", "seconds": 130.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.048, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "fd899d0f292d01d7", "words": 371, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "May 2026. Recreation and Parks signs its gift report:", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.94, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "Recreation and Parks, 2026-05", "text": "Signed cover page: $750,632 in 17 gifts", "mark": "$750,632"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.4, 1.72, 2.31, 2.43, 2.75, 3.1, 3.26, 3.5]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "17 gifts, worth 750,632 dollars.", "t0": 4.94, "t1": 10.49, "shot": "b0a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$750,632", "label": "in 17 gifts", "sub": "the signed cover pages"}, "emph": ["750,632"], "wt": [0.04, 0.63, 1.68, 1.98, 2.29, 2.57, 2.87, 3.84, 4.15, 4.56, 5.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The City’s published list of those gifts holds one. It’s worth 577 dollars.", "t0": 10.61, "t1": 15.77, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "Recreation and Parks, 2026-05", "sub": "the same month, two records", "rows": [["Signed cover pages", "17 gifts, $750,632"], ["Published list", "1 gift, $577"]]}, "emph": ["577"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.84, 1.05, 1.15, 1.39, 1.69, 1.98, 2.77, 2.97, 3.21, 3.5, 3.8, 4.41]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat", "story[5]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. Almost certainly a publishing fault, not concealment.", "t0": 16.29, "t1": 20.89, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.33, 0.43, 0.9, 1.1, 1.18, 2.32, 2.66, 3.0, 3.08, 3.54, 3.84, 4.05]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[1]", "links[2]", "links[3]"], "text": "Departments report each gift they accept.", "t0": 21.11, "t1": 23.15, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Departments", "sub": "file monthly gift reports"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Signed cover pages", "sub": "totals per filing"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Published list of gifts", "sub": "one row per gift and donor"}], "kicker": "Ethics Commission open data"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.89, 1.12, 1.37, 1.51]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[1]", "links[2]", "links[3]"], "text": "A signed cover page, and a list of each gift and donor.", "t0": 23.27, "t1": 25.95, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Departments", "sub": "file monthly gift reports"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Signed cover pages", "sub": "totals per filing"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Published list of gifts", "sub": "one row per gift and donor"}], "kicker": "Ethics Commission open data"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.72, 1.03, 1.17, 1.23, 1.44, 1.58, 1.83, 2.14, 2.3]}, {"scene": "how", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[1]", "links[2]", "links[3]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission publishes both. The list is what anyone searches by donor.", "t0": 26.07, "t1": 30.56, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Departments", "sub": "file monthly gift reports"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Signed cover pages", "sub": "totals per filing"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Published list of gifts", "sub": "one row per gift and donor"}], "kicker": "Ethics Commission open data"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.54, 0.95, 1.44, 2.43, 2.64, 2.93, 3.05, 3.23, 3.58, 3.97, 4.13]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "The first lead. Of 318 department-months tested, 47 don’t match the published list.", "t0": 30.78, "t1": 37.04, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "318 department-months tested", "rows": [["Match", "271"], ["Do not match", "47"]]}, "emph": ["47"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 1.36, 1.55, 1.78, 2.14, 2.45, 3.17, 4.26, 4.92, 5.12, 5.38, 5.49, 5.87]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "In 39 of them, the list holds only an amendment’s items.", "t0": 37.16, "t1": 40.36, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "In 39 of the 47", "sub": "the list keeps only the amendment’s items", "rows": [["Amendment’s items", "listed"], ["Original filing’s gifts", "missing", 1]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.64, 0.75, 1.15, 1.31, 1.52, 1.81, 2.06, 2.14, 2.57]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "The original filing’s gifts are missing.", "t0": 40.48, "t1": 42.1, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "In 39 of the 47", "sub": "the list keeps only the amendment’s items", "rows": [["Amendment’s items", "listed"], ["Original filing’s gifts", "missing", 1]]}, "emph": ["missing"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.46, 0.89, 1.14, 1.26]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount", "links[3]"], "text": "In 37, that leaves 2.5 million dollars of reported gifts with no donor visible.", "t0": 42.22, "t1": 47.73, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.5 million", "label": "of reported gifts, no donor visible", "sub": "37 department-months"}, "emph": ["2.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 1.21, 1.46, 1.71, 1.96, 2.21, 2.49, 2.78, 3.09, 3.2, 3.6, 4.08, 4.36, 4.62, 4.9]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Invisible to anyone searching by donor.", "t0": 48.15, "t1": 49.99, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Invisible"], "sub": "to anyone searching by donor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.65, 1.01, 1.34, 1.48]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "form", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The signed filings confirm it. The list carries none of the 52 filings a later one replaced.", "t0": 50.11, "t1": 55.36, "shot": "b7a", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "52 replaced filings", "sub": "the signed PDFs, set against the list", "rows": [["In the published list", "0"], ["Gifts on no filing the list holds", "494"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.41, 0.86, 1.27, 2.1, 2.29, 2.57, 2.95, 3.12, 3.19, 3.31, 3.8, 4.22, 4.31, 4.53, 4.67]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "form", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "On 42 of them, 494 gifts are on no filing the list holds. Worth how much?", "t0": 55.48, "t1": 61.84, "shot": "b7a", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "52 replaced filings", "sub": "the signed PDFs, set against the list", "rows": [["In the published list", "0"], ["Gifts on no filing the list holds", "494"]]}, "emph": ["494"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.68, 0.77, 1.25, 1.52, 1.84, 2.34, 2.71, 2.93, 3.11, 3.35, 3.73, 3.83, 4.04, 5.2, 5.47, 5.6]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "2.9 million dollars.", "t0": 61.84, "t1": 63.54, "shot": "b7b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.9 million", "label": "in gifts on no filing the list holds", "sub": "34 department-months"}, "emph": ["2.9 million"], "wt": [0.04, 0.27, 0.54, 0.76, 1.04]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "In that May 2026 report, the largest missing gift is 611,000 dollars,", "t0": 64.06, "t1": 70.52, "shot": "b7c", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Jewish Federation Bay Area", "kicker": "Recreation and Park, May 2026", "sub": "the largest gift missing from the list", "chip": "$611,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.32, 0.59, 0.89, 1.45, 2.45, 2.63, 3.01, 3.32, 3.74, 3.98, 4.27, 4.61, 4.9, 5.22]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "from Jewish Federation Bay Area.", "t0": 70.52, "t1": 72.57, "shot": "b7cx", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Jewish Federation Bay Area", "kicker": "Recreation and Park, May 2026", "sub": "the largest gift missing from the list", "chip": "$611,000"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.3, 0.64, 1.18, 1.47]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The second lead: amendments are common.", "t0": 72.79, "t1": 74.8, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "49", "label": "of 387 cover pages are amendments", "sub": "$1.8 million in gifts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.73, 1.19, 1.32]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "49 of 387 cover pages, carrying 1.8 million dollars.", "t0": 74.92, "t1": 79.84, "shot": "b8c", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "49", "label": "of 387 cover pages are amendments", "sub": "$1.8 million in gifts"}, "emph": ["49"], "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.76, 0.99, 1.32, 1.86, 2.13, 2.91, 3.3, 3.48, 3.7, 3.89, 4.2]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Most from Recreation and Parks, the City Administrator, and the Library. Every one gives a reason.", "t0": 79.96, "t1": 85.76, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Amendments, by department", "rows": [["Recreation and Parks", "14"], ["City Administrator", "11"], ["Library", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.55, 1.06, 1.19, 1.93, 2.1, 2.36, 3.02, 3.22, 3.33, 4.43, 4.68, 4.83, 5.05, 5.15]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Amending to add a late gift is what the form provides for.", "t0": 85.88, "t1": 88.91, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Amending a report to add a late gift is what the form provides for."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.58, 0.74, 0.81, 1.02, 1.35, 1.47, 1.64, 1.75, 2.03, 2.45]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "That’s why dropping originals loses so much.", "t0": 89.03, "t1": 91.04, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Amending a report to add a late gift is what the form provides for."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.39, 0.74, 1.18, 1.5, 1.65]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "The third lead: what a donor check misses.", "t0": 91.26, "t1": 93.41, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["San Francisco Symphony gave the Arts Commission", "$2.2 million"], "b": ["The Arts Commission paid it", "$13.5 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.4, 0.89, 1.08, 1.14, 1.4, 1.66]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "San Francisco Symphony gave the Arts Commission 2.2 million dollars in gifts.", "t0": 93.53, "t1": 97.85, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["San Francisco Symphony gave the Arts Commission", "$2.2 million"], "b": ["The Arts Commission paid it", "$13.5 million"]}, "emph": ["2.2 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.74, 1.19, 1.37, 1.5, 1.73, 2.44, 2.7, 2.92, 3.11, 3.42, 3.76, 3.88]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "Around the same years, the Commission paid it 13.5 million.", "t0": 97.97, "t1": 101.16, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["San Francisco Symphony gave the Arts Commission", "$2.2 million"], "b": ["The Arts Commission paid it", "$13.5 million"]}, "emph": ["13.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.37, 0.62, 0.9, 1.0, 1.39, 1.59, 1.7, 2.17, 2.46, 2.77]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "18 such pairs, 2.6 million dollars given.", "t0": 101.28, "t1": 104.22, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "18", "label": "donor-and-department pairs, gifts beside payments", "sub": "$2.6 million given in all"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.74, 1.14, 1.34, 1.57, 1.8, 2.05, 2.35]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Gifts missing from the list can’t be matched at all.", "t0": 104.34, "t1": 106.75, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "18", "label": "donor-and-department pairs, gifts beside payments", "sub": "$2.6 million given in all"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.64, 0.8, 0.92, 1.31, 1.61, 1.74, 2.06, 2.16]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records don’t show any department hid a gift. The signed filings report them.", "t0": 106.97, "t1": 111.02, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any department hid a gift", "Why the list drops the signed originals"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.42, 0.61, 0.81, 0.99, 1.41, 1.62, 1.7, 2.57, 2.75, 3.08, 3.53, 3.86]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The signed PDFs name those donors. The list anyone searches does not.", "t0": 111.14, "t1": 115.12, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any department hid a gift", "Why the list drops the signed originals"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.38, 0.83, 1.03, 1.22, 2.4, 2.59, 2.84, 3.15, 3.53, 3.74]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it? Ask the Ethics Commission: does an amendment replace the original’s items?", "t0": 115.24, "t1": 121.43, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Ask the Ethics Commission whether an amendment replaces the original’s items, and to restore them"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.31, 0.6, 1.49, 1.77, 1.89, 2.21, 3.47, 3.69, 3.78, 4.21, 4.6, 4.7, 5.15]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "And can they be restored?", "t0": 121.43, "t1": 123.26, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Ask the Ethics Commission whether an amendment replaces the original’s items, and to restore them"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.39, 0.53, 0.66]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A fault in the published data, not a finding about any department or donor.", "t0": 123.26, "t1": 127.31, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.56, 0.66, 0.77, 1.14, 1.98, 2.19, 2.28, 2.63, 2.88, 3.09, 3.57, 3.7]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.43, "t1": 129.31, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.37, 0.47, 0.56, 0.97, 1.13, 1.23]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "One month", "how": "Two records", "lead1": "Lead 1 · originals missing", "lead2": "Lead 2 · amendments", "lead3": "Lead 3 · what a donor check misses", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}